<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0"><strong>Agents now comple=
te nearly half of two-to-four-hour research tasks on their own. But humans =
are still central to AI development.</strong> From March to October, estima=
ted success rose from 23% to 46% for tasks estimated to require two to four=
