em] decoration-1 underline relative" data-analytics=3D"mdx-body-link" href=
=3D"https://openai.com/index/research-acceleration-view-inside-openai/">res=
earch acceleration at OpenAI<!-- -->=E2=81=A0</a>, adding new quantitative =
and qualitative measures of (1) AI uplift across research domains and (2) h=
ow humans remain involved in the research process. Overall, we believe this=
 update provides a broader, though still partial, picture of how research a=
t OpenAI is changing.</p></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><p =
class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">We are sha=
ring this work because, as we wrote in our <a class=3D"transition ease-curv=
e-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0=
.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative" data-analytics=3D"mdx-body-link" h=
ref=3D"https://openai.com/index/frontier-safety-blueprint/">frontier policy=
 blueprint<!-- -->=E2=81=A0</a>=E2=81=A0 and reiterated in our first <a cla=
ss=3D"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-prim=
ary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative" data-ana=
lytics=3D"mdx-body-link" href=3D"https://openai.com/index/research-accelera=
tion-view-inside-openai/">research acceleration report<!-- -->=E2=81=A0</a>=
, we believe that AI labs should be required to track and publicly report i=
ndicators of recursive self-improvement (RSI)=E2=80=94the process by which =
AI accelerates the development of future AI systems.</p></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><p =
class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">As capabil=
ities improve and dramatic AI-driven research acceleration becomes increasi=
ngly possible, we will need to solve novel technical and governance issues =
to maintain human oversight and <a class=3D"transition ease-curve-a duratio=
n-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] dec=
oration-1 underline relative" data-analytics=3D"mdx-body-link" href=3D"http=
s://openai.com/index/an-alien-mind/">safely scale AI systems<!-- -->=E2=81=
=A0</a>. Transparency about indicators of RSI is therefore essential to inf=
orm a public discussion of the capabilities, risks, and required safeguards=
 for increasingly powerful AI; however, our reporting should not be read as=
 an intention to pursue full RSI. We have been heartened to see that severa=
l other organizations have recently contributed to the growing body of work=
 measuring AI R&amp;D acceleration<sup data-mdx-footnote-id=3D"1"><a href=
=3D"https://openai.com/index/research-acceleration-jagged-frontier/#user-co=
ntent-fn-1" class=3D"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-xs text-prim=
ary-100 no-underline hover:text-primary-60 scroll-mt-anchor-offset" id=3D"u=
ser-content-fnref-1" data-footnote-ref=3D"true" aria-describedby=3D"footnot=
e-label">1</a></sup>. Our hope is that this expanded report will help susta=
in and advance these shared measurement norms across the industry.</p></div=
>
