 class=3D"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-d=
ecimal mx-3 ps-4">
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0">The <strong>inputs</stron=
g> to AI research (we focus on coding agents; other inputs include data, hu=
man labor, and compute)</li>
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0">The <strong>process</stro=
ng> by which researchers convert those inputs into model capabilities (AI r=
esearch)</li>
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0">The <strong>outputs</stro=
ng> we see from the AI research process (improvements in model capabilities=
).</li>
</ol></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><p =
class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">We believe=
 organizing the results in this way provides a useful framework for reasoni=
ng about how AI is used in research and how that use might contribute to im=
provements in model capabilities.</p></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
