class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">AI researc=
h uses several inputs, including data, AI tools (e.g., coding agents), huma=
n labor, and compute. In this report, we focus on AI tools as an input to r=
esearch. Specifically, we document how the intensity of coding-agent use va=
ries across teams and changes over time. Further, while we do not directly =
report changes in labor costs, we examine how the share of spending on rese=
arch labor has changed relative to spending on other factors over time.</p>=
</div>
