AI usage within the research organization has continued to increase exponen=
tially. At API list prices, the median researcher now uses around $2,400 US=
D per day on agentic AI tools, and the 90th percentile researcher now aroun=
d $23,000 USD per day, up 62% and 105% respectively from $1,500 and $11,000=
 in September.<sup data-mdx-footnote-id=3D"2"><a href=3D"https://openai.com=
