<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><p =
class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">In a separ=
ate survey in late October, we also asked whether respondents expected to b=
e more productive in their daily work with our latest internal model or wit=
h help from both a mid-career human research engineer and a 2024 model such=
 as o1-preview. 27 of the 28 respondents chose or leaned toward the latest =
internal model. The remaining respondent did not choose between the two opt=
ions as posed and said they would pick GPT-6 Astra over the human-assisted =
option.</p></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16"><h=
4 id=3D"where-big-ideas-come-from" data-article-heading=3D"" class=3D"text-=
h5 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h=
)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]">Where big ideas come from</h4></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><p =
class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">We are als=
o interested in tracking progress in AI-driven idea generation, since the a=
bility to develop and vet conceptual research ideas (research taste) may be=
 a bottleneck for recursive self-improvement. To measure this, we asked one=
 to four researchers who made key contributions in each of three areas (pre=
training, posttraining, and safety monitoring) to name one to three ideas t=
hey considered most important to the GPT-6 Astra and GPT-6.2 Astra releases=
. We then asked how those ideas originated and what role, if any, AI played=
 in developing them.</p></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><p =
class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">For both r=
eleases, posttraining and safety monitoring researchers said that, to their=
 knowledge, people came up with all the ideas they named, and models helped=
 implement them. Pretraining researchers likewise attributed the ideas they=
 identified for GPT-6 Astra entirely to people.</p></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><p =
class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">For GPT-6.=
2 Astra, pretraining researchers described developing ideas in conversation=
 with Codex. One credited Codex with identifying key insights as they worke=
d through an idea together. Another said the main idea was theirs, but it o=
nly started working well after Codex suggested a change.</p></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16"><h=
4 id=3D"changes-in-research-workflows" data-article-heading=3D"" class=3D"t=
ext-h5 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-butt=
on-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]">Changes in research workflows</h4><=
/div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><p =
class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">Lastly, to=
 capture qualitative evidence on workflow changes, we also interviewed ten =
researchers from pretraining, posttraining, and safety on how they used age=
nts. Across these interviews, five main themes emerged, which we summarize =
below:</p></div>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><ul=
 class=3D"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-d=
isc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4">
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0"><strong>Researchers use a=
gents to implement code and debug and oversee experiments:</strong>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><ul=
 class=3D"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-d=
isc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4">
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0">=E2=80=9CI once ported an=
 open-source eval where it was much more involved to get studies and ablati=
ons on 'is this a good eval'. It might have been a week and a half or two t=
o really get to the point of =E2=80=9CCan we use this or not?=E2=80=9D Wher=
eas now, depending on the eval, zero to running it is a day, maybe a few da=
ys.=E2=80=9D<br>
<em>=E2=80=94Researcher 7, safety, working on evaluations</em></li>
</ul></div>
</li>
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0"><strong>Agents have poor =
taste in research ideas, code quality, data quality, and writing:</strong>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><ul=
 class=3D"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-d=
isc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4">
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0">=E2=80=9CThe model genera=
lly can=E2=80=99t one-shot come up with well-posed problems that it cannot =
solve itself. And if you ask the model to generate a data point a hundred t=
imes, it=E2=80=99ll generate similar data points each time.=E2=80=9D<br>
<em>=E2=80=94Researcher 2, safety, working on reinforcement learning enviro=
nments</em></li>
</ul></div>
</li>
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0"><strong>Workflows require=
 close human involvement to avoid low-quality outputs and wasted cycles:</s=
trong> agents struggled to launch experiments efficiently, rabbit-holed on =
unnecessary steps, wrote =E2=80=9CAI slop=E2=80=9D PRs, produced unusable d=
ata artifacts, and made invalid analysis assumptions.<!-- -->
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><ul=
 class=3D"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-d=
isc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4">
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0">=E2=80=9CI've tried sayin=
g, =E2=80=98Just make this task like this other task,=E2=80=99 and been bur=
ned too many times when it's not quite right and I need to make edits. Now =
I say, =E2=80=98Go make one. I'll review it and make edits. Then go do the =
rest.=E2=80=99=E2=80=9D<br>
<em>=E2=80=94Researcher 1, posttraining, working on evaluations</em></li>
</ul></div>
</li>
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0"><strong>Researchers expec=
ted significant improvements in current bottleneck areas:</strong>
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><ul=
 class=3D"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-d=
isc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4">
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0">=E2=80=9CI do think I hav=
e more taste in terms of the ideas. But I have no confidence that will cont=
inue to be true for any significant period of time.=E2=80=9D<br>
<em>=E2=80=94Researcher 8, pretraining, working on architecture and data</e=
m></li>
</ul></div>
</li>
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0"><strong>Researchers see l=
arge uplift from scanning and generating content at scale:</strong> researc=
hers used models to scan thousands of samples to diagnose issues in experim=
ents, flag concerning instances of model behavior, and build and QC new dat=
asets.<!-- -->
<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><ul=
 class=3D"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-d=
isc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4">
<li class=3D"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0">=E2=80=9COne thing I did =
recently was look through all of our data=E2=80=A6 I had it do a couple of =
rounds and calibrated what it was giving me. =E2=80=A6 It gave me a really =
nice, giant sheet with everything organized. =E2=80=A6 Without AI, this wou=
ld have been super painful.=E2=80=9D<br>
<em>=E2=80=94Researcher 3, posttraining, working on data quality</em></li>
</ul></div>
</li>
</ul></div>
