<div class=3D"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:=
col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6"><p =
class=3D"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0">Beyond cha=
nges in research inputs and workflows, we also want to understand whether A=
I use is accelerating research progress. To inform this question, we presen=
t three measures. Two of them=E2=80=94lines of code and the number of resea=
rch experiments=E2=80=94were included in our <a class=3D"transition ease-cu=
rve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-=
